# Cloudflare Pages redirects for home.corporatetambola.com.
# /version.json must be answered by this site, never sent to another host. The only rules that leave the site are the four sign-in guesses below (20 Nov 2026 smoke test: an organizer who types /login got a 404).
# tools/build.mjs fails the build if a rule here mentions /version.json or points a page at another host (except the console sign-in, 302).
/login https://console.corporatetambola.com/ 302
/signin https://console.corporatetambola.com/ 302
/sign-in https://console.corporatetambola.com/ 302
/console https://console.corporatetambola.com/ 302

# The old separate legal pages are one document at /terms (owner order, 1 Nov 2026): each old address answers 301 to its section.
